        "PMC8838792::web::011::3_results",
        "PMC6427115::web::014::4_2_corrosion_resistance"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Engineering alloys used in nuclear applications commonly contain chromium to protect against air oxidation.",
